    "value": "If the solid region $R$ is given by \n\n$$\nR=\\{(x,y,z)\\hspace{0.167em}:\\hspace{0.167em}(x-3)^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 9,\\hspace{0.222em}y\\le 0,\\hspace{0.222em}y\\le z\\le 6\\},\n$$\n\nthen $$\n\\displaystyle {\u222d}_{R}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{z+7}}\\,\\text{d}V=\n$$",
